  "title": "Weekly Update 526: Building HIBP AI/SI First",
  "url": "https://www.troyhunt.com/weekly-update-526/",
  "content": "<img alt=\"Weekly Update 526: Building HIBP AI/SI First\" src=\"https://storage.ghost.io/c/fb/33/fb3391dc-723d-4e74-b95a-d641b5feb38e/content/images/2026/10/image.jpg\" /><p>I have this sense that we&apos;ve passed the point where &quot;vibe coding&quot; is a derogatory term. I have no empirical evidence for this; it&apos;s more a feeling that those weaponising the term have now accepted the inevitability and are just getting with the program. Or they&apos;ve reskilled into other industries because, let&apos;s face it: you can&apos;t be a productive, <em>competitive</em> developer today without AI. I saw this comment from Linus Torvalds today which I thought really nailed it:</p>\n<!--kg-card-begin: html-->\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet\"><p dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\">&#x203c;&#xfe0f; Linus Torvalds called rules against AI coding tools &quot;UTTERLY STUPID&quot; on the Linux kernel mailing list.\n\nHe says people he respects and calls intelligent do not shy away from using new tools. https://t.co/HaQ8H4BrVc</p>&#x2014; International Cyber Digest (@IntCyberDigest) <a href=\"https://x.com/IntCyberDigest/status/2111592082297270339?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw&amp;ref=troyhunt.com\">October 17, 2026</a></blockquote>\n\n<!--kg-card-end: html-->\n<p>He&apos;s always had a way with words &#x1f642; Anyway, here&apos;s what we&apos;re doing:</p>\n<!--kg-card-begin: html-->\n<div><div style=\"width: 170px; display: inline-block; margin-right: 3px;\"><a href=\"https://itunes.apple.com/au/podcast/troy-hunts-weekly-update-podcast/id1176454699?ref=troy-hunt\"><img alt=\"Weekly Update 526: Building HIBP AI/SI First\" src=\"https://storage.ghost.io/c/fb/33/fb3391dc-723d-4e74-b95a-d641b5feb38e/content/images/2018/05/Listen-on-Apple-Podcasts.svg\" /></a></div><div style=\"width: 175px; display: inline-block; margin-right: 3px;\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL7LAAxaabizMAXnJe0s3xjQ30q12EVmjt&amp;ref=troyhunt.com\"><img alt=\"Weekly Update 526: Building HIBP AI/SI First\" src=\"https://storage.ghost.io/c/fb/33/fb3391dc-723d-4e74-b95a-d641b5feb38e/content/images/2024/09/Watch-and-Listen-on-YouTube.svg\" /></a></div><div style=\"width: 118px; display: inline-block; margin-right: 3px;\"><a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/show/7jMtKFohdrw6qmz8AkLqit?ref=troy-hunt\"><img alt=\"Weekly Update 526: Building HIBP AI/SI First\" class=\"kg-image\" src=\"https://storage.ghost.io/c/fb/33/fb3391dc-723d-4e74-b95a-d641b5feb38e/content/images/2019/10/spotify.svg\" /></a></div><div style=\"width: 120px; display: inline-block;\"><a href=\"https://omny.fm/shows/troy-hunt-weekly-update/playlists/podcast.rss?ref=troy-hunt\"><img alt=\"Weekly Update 526: Building HIBP AI/SI First\" src=\"https://storage.ghost.io/c/fb/33/fb3391dc-723d-4e74-b95a-d641b5feb38e/content/images/2018/07/Download-via-RSS.svg\" /></a></div></div>\n<!--kg-card-end: html-->"
